"""Write the full-film media jobs and prompts. Does not call a provider."""
from pathlib import Path
import json
B=Path('episodes/immortal/full');O=Path('output/imagegen/immortal-film-v2');P=B/'prompts';P.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True);O.mkdir(parents=True,exist_ok=True)
S=Path('output/imagegen/immortal-sample-v1')
common='Detailed crisp pixel art matching the reference, confident dark contours, warm amber rim light against cool blue shadows, natural compact RPG proportions, clear eyes and hands. No blur, green fringe, labels, logos or extra figures. '
sheet='Exactly FOUR complete full-body figures in an evenly spaced 2 by 2 sheet, each entirely inside its quadrant with at least 90 pixels clear margin around hair, hands, clothing and feet. Flat pure magenta #FF00FF background, no floor or cast shadows. Match scale and face size across poses. '
jobs=[]
def job(id,ref,desc,size='2048x2048',hold=.9,kind='sheet'):
 prompt='Use case: '+('identity-preserve' if kind=='sheet' else 'historical-scene')+'\nInput image: '+('exact character identity reference' if id.startswith(('norbert','marcus','witch')) else 'pixel-art style and finish reference only')+'.\n'+common+(sheet if kind=='sheet' else '')+desc+'\n'
 (P/f'{id}.txt').write_text(prompt);jobs.append({'id':id,'reference':str(ref),'promptFile':str(P/f'{id}.txt'),'output':str(O/f'{id}.png'),'size':size,'quality':'high','holdUsd':hold,'kind':kind})
job('witch-alert-four',Path('public/pixel/cast/witch-four-v1.png'),'Preserve the SAME exact familiar young adult witch: face, grey-streaked dark curls, purple hat with gold buckle, purple cape, fitted blue tunic, belt, dark trousers and boots. Change the resting expression in ALL poses: BOTH EYES naturally FULLY OPEN, alert and friendly, relaxed brows and a small warm smile. Never half-closed or sleepy eyes, no eye-roll. Top left: relaxed neutral standing, empty hands. Top right: one gentle open-palm speaking gesture with natural mouth. Bottom left: a softer compassionate expression, one hand over heart and one empty hand extended. Bottom right: offers one small rolled parchment forward, other hand open. No glowing eyes, no new outfit or altered face.')
job('marcus-age-four',S/'marcus-young-four.png','Age the SAME exact Marcus across the four poses. Preserve his face shape, curly brown hair structure, warm brown eyes, ivory linen tunic, muted moss vest, belt, trousers and boots. Top left: middle-aged Marcus, a few grey curls, standing with one hand on a stiff lower back. Top right: the same middle-aged Marcus holding a recognisable wicker basket of turnips at waist height, slightly stooped but cheerful. Bottom left: elderly Marcus with grey curly hair, wrinkles and a short grey beard, leaning on a simple walking stick, kind eyes fully open. Bottom right: the same elderly Marcus seated in a bed posture with knees bent and both feet visible, a blanket over his legs, one hand gently reaching to a friend outside the image. No bed or room drawn, no illness gore. The age changes are clear but this remains one recognisable person.')
job('anna-four',Path('public/pixel/cast/witch-four-v1.png'),'Create a DISTINCT young ADULT woman named Anna, around 25, Amsterdam 1650. She is not the witch: no hat, no purple cape. Chestnut-brown hair in a loose braid with small flyaways, warm hazel eyes fully open, freckles, friendly confident face. Cream linen blouse with modest square neckline, muted olive bodice, dark teal ankle-length skirt, soft brown shoes; a small muted ochre apron. Same woman and outfit in all cells. Top left: standing at a market, one hand on hip and the other holding one purple-and-ivory turnip, amused bargaining expression. Top right: genuinely laughing, open welcoming hand. Bottom left: softly concerned, direct attentive eyes and one hand extended in a sincere question. Bottom right: seated on an invisible bench, one hand supporting a small plain grey rock with NO face, smiling warmly. All heads and full silhouettes visible. Original character, no text or exaggerated makeup.')
job('norbert-medieval-four',S/'norbert-476-four.png','Preserve the exact red-scarf Norbert face, tousled navy hair, skin, body proportions and physical age 22. Outfit for an Italian town in 1348: muted teal wool tunic over cream linen sleeves, brown belt with simple pouch, charcoal hose, soft dark boots, the SAME bright red scarf. No plague-doctor mask. Top left: standing alert and uneasy, empty hands. Top right: carrying a wooden water bucket at his side, leaning slightly to balance the weight. Bottom left: one hand holds a quill at a believable waist-height writing surface, the other supports a small open book, concerned focus. Bottom right: seated on an invisible low step, holding the ordinary faceLESS grey rock with both hands near his lap, quiet reflective eyes, no sobbing.')
job('norbert-earlymodern-four',S/'norbert-476-four.png','Preserve the exact Norbert face, hair, skin, red scarf and physical age 22 across all four figures. Top left: England 1538 outfit, muted dark teal wool doublet, linen collar, charcoal hose, brown shoes, no hat over his recognisable hair; standing with an awkward hopeful smile and open hand. Top right: SAME 1538 outfit, standing and answering a clerk, both empty hands slightly raised. Bottom left: Amsterdam 1650 outfit, charcoal wool coat and breeches, cream linen shirt and small folded white collar, dark stockings, brown buckle shoes, red scarf draped naturally at the neck; standing with a small smile, one plain grey faceLESS rock in a hand. Bottom right: SAME 1650 outfit, still formal portrait pose with one hand resting naturally at waist height and the other by his side, amused patient eyes. Distinct era clothes but identical body/face. No tables or scenery.')
job('norbert-industrial-four',S/'norbert-modern-four.png','Preserve exact Norbert face, hair, skin, red scarf and physical age 22. Top left: 1839 outfit, dark teal waistcoat over an ivory shirt, dark trousers, brown boots, simple neckcloth beneath the red scarf; standing patiently with relaxed hands. Top right: same 1839 outfit, a SINGLE expressive sneeze pose, eyes briefly squeezed shut and an elbow raised, complete body and all hands visible, no spray or text. Bottom left: 1920 traveller outfit, muted dark teal wool overcoat over a cream shirt, charcoal trousers and brown boots, red scarf, small brown travel satchel; standing in a queue with a tired polite smile. Bottom right: same 1920 outfit, offering one plain faceLESS grey rock in his open palm with an awkward hopeful expression. No period camera, papers, room or background props.')
job('gate-kid-four',S/'norbert-modern-four.png','Create a DISTINCT nine-year-old boy, shorter than Norbert with recognisably childlike proportions. Soft sandy-brown hair, round cheerful face, clear blue-grey eyes fully open, muted mustard hoodie over an ivory tee, navy trousers, teal trainers and a small blue backpack. No red scarf. Same child and outfit in every cell. Top left: standing with curious eyes, empty hands. Top right: points gently toward a small object outside the image, friendly questioning face. Bottom left: seated on an invisible airport bench, scooting to one side and patting the empty space beside him. Bottom right: seated rock-paper-scissors gesture, one fist held out over his other open palm, laughing. Full head, legs, shoes and hands in each cell, no actual bench or scenery.')
job('period-support-four',S/'late-antique-support-four.png','Create FOUR DISTINCT supporting adults, one in each quadrant, all same pixel-art world and full standing figures. Top left: an Italian priest in 1348, middle-aged with a simple tonsure and small grey beard, plain cream robe with muted brown mantle, holding a closed book, stern worried eyes. Top right: an English parish clerk in 1538, older man with a soft dark cap, muted burgundy wool robe and linen collar, holding a quill and a ledger, dry questioning expression. Bottom left: a photographer in 1839, adult man with sideburns, charcoal waistcoat over ivory shirt, muted brown trousers and boots, one hand raised to ask for stillness, no camera drawn. Bottom right: a border guard in 1920, adult man with neat moustache, muted olive uniform and peaked cap with no real insignia, holding an open document and looking at a traveller to his left. No modern cameras or badges, no text, no gore.')
back='An EMPTY environment plate for separately animated characters. Fixed eye-level gently frontal camera, clear foreground floor at the lower middle, layered depth, rich textures and a strong readable focal area. No people, human silhouettes, animals, text, signs, banners or logos. Keep any main foreground story furniture out of the plate so it is not duplicated by the animated stage. '
def bg(id,ref,desc):job(id,ref,back+desc,'2048x1152',.6,'background')
bg('farmhouse-interior',S/'witch-hut-empty-v2.png','A modest late-antique Italian farmhouse in 476: warm whitewashed walls, dark oak roof beams, small blue evening window, a low stone hearth glowing amber, rear shelves with earthenware bowls and a simple linen curtain. Warm and welcoming, no magical objects. Open central floor for a table and two chairs to be added; do not draw that table, chairs or a bed. Muted teal and honey amber, no muddy brown wash.')
bg('farmhouse-reverse',S/'ravenna-field-wide-476.png','Reverse interior view of the same modest late-antique farmhouse, looking from beside the hearth toward a heavy timber door and a small window showing the same red-tiled rural buildings. Whitewashed stone walls, simple rear pottery shelf, low amber hearth rim at the far left, dawn blue outside. Open clear floor in the middle for separate actors, no foreground table, chairs or bed. Plausible single room with stable geometry.')
bg('ravenna-winter',S/'ravenna-field-wide-476.png','Precise season change of the reference farm: keep the SAME farmhouse, cart, well, paths, skyline and camera. Now winter, bare trees, thin snow on roof tiles and sleeping crop beds, pale blue dawn with warm light at the farmhouse window. No people or animals. Preserve the exact main landmarks for a matched time jump.')
bg('plague-lane-1348',S/'witch-hut-exterior.png','A 1348 Italian town lane at cold violet-blue dusk, medieval stone and plaster houses, tiled roofs, timber doors, small amber candles behind shuttered windows, an empty well and a narrow arch farther back. Damp cobbles catch restrained warm reflections. A folded linen cloth rests on a rear ledge, but no bodies, gore or masks. Quiet and lonely. Clear foreground path for a traveller carrying water.')
