bg('amsterdam-market-1650',S/'ravenna-field-wide-476.png','An Amsterdam canal-side market in 1650 at golden hour: Dutch stepped-gable brick houses, narrow canal reflecting muted blue sky, small moored wooden boat, stone quay, a rear stall with baskets of root vegetables and folded linen awnings. Clear foreground cobbled quay for two actors to bargain. No modern buildings, bikes, street signs or people. Warm gold and restrained teal, crisp detailed pixel-art architecture.')
bg('portrait-studio-1650',S/'witch-hut-empty-v2.png','An Amsterdam portrait painter’s studio in 1650 at late golden afternoon. Tall window with cool blue fill from the left, amber light on muted plaster walls, rear shelves with pigment jars and brushes, draped dark fabric, an empty gilded frame leaning at the rear. Open central floor for a seated model and a separate easel; do not include the model, chair, easel or painting in the central stage. Rich gold against deep blue, not a magic laboratory.')
bg('photo-studio-1839',S/'witch-hut-empty-v2.png','An 1839 daguerreotype studio: tall side window with soft cool daylight, dark draped backdrop at the back, period wooden floor and plaster walls, rear shelf with closed metal plate cases. Warm low oil-lamp glow on brass hardware at a distant side shelf, cool blue shadows. Clear central floor for a large box camera, tripod and seated subject to be added. NO cameras, tripod, chair, electric lights, modern photo prints or people in the foreground.')
bg('border-office-1920',S/'airport-security-empty-v2.png','A European railway border checkpoint in 1920, an interior with tall frosted panes, heavy timber door, rear luggage shelf and plain wooden wall panels, a small amber wall lamp and cool dawn light. Clear foreground floor for one inspection desk and queued travellers to be added. No desk or foreground chair, no modern airport machines, no electric screens, logos, flags, readable posters, signs or people. Muted navy and amber.')
bg('airport-bench-2026',S/'airport-security-reverse.png','Another STATIC view of this exact modern glass airport terminal, now a quiet gate waiting area. Preserve the same blue-hour window grid, apron lights, distant plane and polished tile floor. A rear planter and empty metal railing add depth. Clear central foreground space for an airport bench with two people, but do not draw a bench or any people. Warm gold from a nearby ceiling light against cool blue windows. No text or readable terminal signs.')
(B/'image-jobs.json').write_text(json.dumps(jobs,indent=2)+'\n')
